### =====================================================================================
### Payer Gateway Web API - the whole prior authorization flow, in order.
### Run it in Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client). Needs: FHIR API (5100), mock EHR (5090), mock payer (5080).
### Replace formId / questionnaire linkIds with the values returned by the calls above them.
### =====================================================================================
@gateway = http://localhost:5200

### 0. Which payers can the EHR name?
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/payers

### 0b. Test the payer connection (CDS Hooks discovery)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payers/MockPayer/discover

### 1. CRD: the order is signed -> read callDtr / callPas / questionnaireUrls / coverageAssertionId
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/crd/order-sign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-20260929-0001",
  "payerName": "MockPayer",
  "patientId": "pat-1",
  "orderIds": ["ord-1-hd"],
  "orderLocationCode": "loc-main",
  "userPractitionerId": "prac-1"
}

### 2a. DTR: get the payer's questionnaire as simple questions (callDtr = true)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/dtr/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerName": "MockPayer",
  "patientId": "pat-1",
  "orderIds": ["ord-1-hd"],
  "questionnaireUrls": ["http://example.org/fhir/Questionnaire/dialysis-incenter-hd"],
  "coverageAssertionId": "CA-20260929-0001"
}

### 2b. DTR: answer it (use the formId and linkIds from 2a)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/dtr/forms/frm-000000000000/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complete": true,
  "authorPractitionerId": "prac-1",
  "answers": [
    { "linkId": "egfr", "values": ["12"] },
    { "linkId": "on-dialysis", "values": ["true"] },
    { "linkId": "esrd-date", "values": ["2026-08-10"] }
  ]
}

### 2c. DTR: read the form back
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/dtr/forms/frm-000000000000

### 3. PAS: submit (completed DTR forms of ord-1-hd are attached automatically)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pas/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "PA-2026-0001",
  "payerName": "MockPayer",
  "patientId": "pat-1",
  "requestingPractitionerId": "prac-1",
  "orderLocationCode": "loc-main",
  "orderIds": ["ord-1-hd"],
  "priority": "routine",
  "documentIds": ["doc-1-note"],
  "notes": "Patient started hemodialysis on 2026-09-01."
}

### 3b. PAS: latest stored decision
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001

### 3c. PAS: ask the payer now ($inquire)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001/inquire

### 4a. CDex: what does the payer need? (pended requests)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/cdex/requests/PA-2026-0001/information-requests?refresh=true

### 4b. CDex: send the additional documents
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/cdex/requests/PA-2026-0001/attachments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentIds": ["doc-1-labs"],
  "final": true
}

### 5. Cancel (optional)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pas/requests/PA-2026-0001/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Order cancelled by the physician." }

### 6. Payer SMART DTR app: forms the app saved for an order (DTR_MODE = SmartApp)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/dtr/saved-forms?patientId=pat-1&orderId=ord-1-hd

### 7. Payers with their FHIR release and DTR mode
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/payers
